IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `rta-road`

-- Road Traffic Act 1974 (WA), with the Road Traffic Code 2000 and the Road Traffic regulations, s 49, 49AB, 60A, 60B, 61, 62, 64-64AAA; Code r 3A, 5, 11, 13, 15, 17, 210B, 223B, 228; ATD Regulations r 55, 65; Vehicles Regulations r 15; Administration Regulations r 23 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. The figures come from the deposited Act, Road Traffic Code
-- 2000 and regulations; nothing here has been checked against a decided case.
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_wa_road-traffic-act-1974_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

-- Life facts used are from the workbench scenario au/wa/cradle-to-grave-jake/facts.json: Jake born 30 August 2006;
-- k042 (14 July 2027, age 20) on the footpath at 10 km/h, then on a 60 km/h road; k083 (19 July 2049, age 42) 25 km/h
-- over on a motorcycle. HYPOTHETICAL: his device's specifications (an e-scooter within r 3A; the scenario calls it an
-- "e-bike"), his 20 km/h on the 60 road, the 80 km/h zone and his 105 km/h for k083, and every other fixture. That
-- 19 July 2049 is not in a holiday period is an INFERENCE (as in the Authorisation to Drive baseline).

