§ `Code r 3A -- k042: is Jake's device an eRideable`

#ASSERT `What kind of device am I riding` `Jake's e-scooter` EQUALS `an electric rideable device`
#ASSERT `What kind of device am I riding` `a pedal e-bike` EQUALS `not an electric rideable device, because it has pedals (it may be a bicycle or power assisted pedal cycle)`
#ASSERT `What kind of device am I riding` `a scooter that does 45 km/h on its motor` EQUALS `not an electric rideable device, because it does not meet r 3A(1)`
#ASSERT `What kind of device am I riding` `a 30 kg scooter of a kind the Minister has approved` EQUALS `an electric rideable device`

